<title>USA: USDA adds products to Russia GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds products to Russia GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said it has added processed meat products and dehydrated instant soup to the U.S. commodities available to Russia under the GSM-102 program.</p>
<p>USDA said the total fiscal 1997 allocation for sales to Russia under the GSM-102 remains unchanged at $30 million.</p>
</text>
